---
id: summarize
harpoon: "1.1"
name: Topic Summarizer
description: Summarizes a topic and returns structured JSON

input:
  topic:
    type: string
    required: true
    description: The topic to summarize

output:
  format: json
  schema:
    summary:
      type: string
      description: A one-sentence summary of the topic
    keywords:
      type: array
      description: Three keywords related to the topic
---
Summarize the following topic in one sentence and provide exactly three keywords.

Topic: {{ topic }}
